-- TESTING -------------------------------------------------------------------
  Tested      Run by script through the real loader on a NextZXOS 26.11 card
              copy, default, Enhanced and cheats; 1.0 not yet played by the
              owner; published at his request

  Replay      Default: no hooks, every snapshot bank byte for byte in the
              .nex, unchanged from the earlier review. Enhanced: 7 scripted
              recordings, 42006 frames, 425828 hooks run on the verifier:
              every register with R, all 48K RAM bar the sites and dead stack,
              the clock and MMU against the original at each; 9459 back-buffer
              pictures, 271208448 pixels, against a model that reads the set
              afresh; 12 broken builds caught

  Emulator    JNext 1.1.104 headless: through the real .NEXCLASH loader on a
              private NextZXOS 26.11 card copy, default, Enhanced and cheats,
              output byte for byte as nxc.py makes it, reaching play;
              15-minute soaks; flicker

  Coverage    Scripted input, no human play: title, wave 1, every wave and the
              ending by test pokes, deaths and game over; not natural
              completion

  Hardware    none

  Nothing here claims a result on real hardware unless the line above says so.

-- HOW TO USE ----------------------------------------------------------------
  Put this .nxc and the game file in the same folder on the Next's card and
  choose the .nxc in the Browser. See README.txt.
